@startuml C1_Missing_Plans_Process_View
title C1 – Missing Operation Plans (Process View)

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "Missing Plans UI" as UI
participant "TodoApi" as Gateway
participant "OEM Service" as OEM
participant "VVN Repository" as VvnRepo
participant "Plans Repository" as PlansRepo

Operator -> UI : Select date & open "Missing Plans"
UI -> Gateway : GET /api/oem/operation-plans/missing?date=...
Gateway -> OEM : Forward GET
OEM -> VvnRepo : Fetch VVNs for date
OEM -> PlansRepo : Check plans linked to VVNs
PlansRepo --> OEM : Existing plan IDs
VvnRepo --> OEM : VVN list
OEM --> Gateway : Missing VVNs JSON
Gateway --> UI : Render list

Operator -> UI : Click "Regenerar"
UI -> Gateway : POST /api/oem/operation-plans/regenerate-missing
Gateway -> OEM : Forward POST (with confirmOverwrite)
OEM -> PlansRepo : Delete / overwrite plans
OEM -> Scheduling Engine : Generate plans
Scheduling Engine --> OEM : Generated plans + metadata
OEM -> PlansRepo : Persist plans
OEM --> Gateway : Response with plans + warnings
Gateway --> UI : Show success + metadata + warnings

@enduml
